        <headline>Flood Advisory issued September 24 at 3:51PM AST until September 24 at 4:00PM AST by NWS San Juan PR</headline>
        <description>The Flood Advisory will expire at 4 PM AST this afternoon for a
portion of Puerto Rico, including the following areas, Arecibo,
Ciales, Florida, Jayuya and Utuado.

The heavy rain has ended. Flooding is no longer expected to pose a
threat. Please continue to heed remaining road closures.
</description>
